neutral and the quest home alter is non-aligned and produces ghosts.

I also hit the magic traps hard to get my charisma up once my
character is strong enough.  That makes the foocubus success rate
higher.

Which reminds me, I typically do the polymorph trap - pet thing.  So
when I produce a foocubus pet, I use them too.

